@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title 图 10  时序图 —— 一次攻击的完整结算过程

actor "亚瑟\n(Combatant)" as ATK
participant "旋风斩\n(AttackSkill)" as SK
participant "DamageChain" as DC
participant "DodgeHandler" as D1
participant "ArmorHandler" as D2
participant "BlockHandler" as D3
participant "CritHandler" as D4
participant "暗影魔龙\n(Combatant)" as DEF
participant "EventBus" as BUS

ATK -> SK : execute(caster, target, bus)
activate SK

SK -> DC : resolve(caster, target, 倍率 1.4)
activate DC

DC -> D1 : handle(ctx)
activate D1
D1 -> D1 : roll01() < dodgeRate ?
note right of D1 : 命中，继续向后传递
D1 -> D2 : handle(ctx)
deactivate D1

activate D2
D2 -> ATK : damageType() == 物理
D2 -> DEF : def() == 20
D2 -> D2 : ctx.damage = max(1, 43 x 1.4 - 20) = 40
D2 -> D3 : handle(ctx)
deactivate D2

activate D3
D3 -> D3 : roll01() < blockRate(18%) ?
note right of D3 : 未触发，伤害不变
D3 -> D4 : handle(ctx)
deactivate D3

activate D4
D4 -> D4 : roll01() < critRate(22%) ? 触发
D4 -> D4 : ctx.damage = 40 x 2.0 = 80
deactivate D4

DC --> SK : ctx { damage=80, crit=true }
deactivate DC

SK -> DEF : takeDamage(80, "亚瑟")
activate DEF
DEF -> DEF : 实际伤害 = 80 x 状态易伤系数
DEF --> SK : 实际扣血值
deactivate DEF

SK -> BUS : notify(CriticalHit, 源=亚瑟, 目标=暗影魔龙, 值=80)
activate BUS
BUS --> SK : 已分发给全部观察者
deactivate BUS

SK -> DEF : inflictState(Stunned)  —— 按 25% 概率
activate DEF
DEF -> DEF : 若目标免疫控制则忽略
DEF -> BUS : notify(StateChanged)
deactivate DEF

SK --> ATK :
deactivate SK

note over D1, D4
  <b>责任链的四个环节</b>
  任一环节都可改变结果（格挡/暴击）甚至终止流程（闪避）。
  新增"反伤""护盾吸收"只需实现一个 DamageHandler 并挂到链上。
  <b>环节只判定，出口才广播</b>：本图示例中格挡未触发，
  故只广播了一条 CriticalHit；若格挡触发，出口 performAttack()
  会在扣血之后<b>额外</b>广播一条 EventType::Blocked，
  由战斗日志（⊘ 前缀）与成就系统（「铜墙铁壁」）分别消费。
end note

@enduml
